(c) Providing for the discontinuance of local, short and narrow streets and private ways, and for the establishment of a rational and efficient street network which reduces congestion, improves traffic flow, including truck access to and through the project area, and otherwise conforms to the objectives, design principles, and other controls of the Plan;
(d) Providing for the redevelopment of Massachusetts Bay

Transportation Authority (MBTA) facilities in such a way
